      'Origin of knowledge: Brahma -> Prajapati -> Ashvini Kumaras -> Indra -> Bharadwaja -> Punarvasu Atreya -> Agnivesha and six disciples',
      'Five types of Aushadha: Shamana (palliative), Shodhana (puritative), Nidana Parivarjana (removal of cause), Pathya Vyavastha (dietary regulation), Swastha Vritta (preventive regimen)',
