      'Honey (Madhu): supports nose and tongue - antimicrobial properties for sensory organ protection',
      'Milk (Ksheera): nourishes skin and ears - provides Snigdha (unctuous) quality for sensory organ lubrication',
      'Triphala: supports all sense organs - daily use as eyewash, oral rinse, and internal supplement',
      'Avoid foods that aggravate specific dosha affecting sense organs: Pitta-aggravating for eyes, Vata-aggravating for ears',
      'Proper eating habits: calm environment, mindful eating, proper quantity - supports taste organ (Rasana) health',
      'Adequate hydration: supports all sense organs, especially eyes and skin',
