      'Pitta Prakriti (sensitive): cool, sweet, mild foods are constitutional - milk, ghee, sweet fruits',
      'Pathological Karshya: Brimhana diet - sweet, heavy, unctuous foods in larger quantities',
      'Pathological Sthoulya: Langhana diet - bitter, astringent, light foods in smaller quantities',
      'Ati-sthula-karshita: balanced diet - moderate protein (Mamsa Rasa), low fat, adequate fiber',
      'Avoid excessive salt - increases Pitta and causes premature aging',
