      'Tikta Rasa (bitter): reduces Kapha-Pitta, does not significantly increase Vata - neem, guduchi, haridra',
      'Katu Rasa (pungent): stimulates Agni, reduces Kapha, increases Vata-Pitta - ginger, pepper, garlic',
      'Kashaya Rasa (astringent): reduces Pitta-Kapha, can increase Vata - haritaki, arjuna, kushtha',
      'Vipaka (post-digestive effect): Madhura Vipaka pacifies Vata, Katu Vipaka pacifies Kapha',
